    "description": "Farm (farmhouse), level 2 of 3: L1 plus flourish 2. The farmer's house: a 9 x 5 timber-framed farmhouse (plaster in dark oak, spruce gable roof, brick chimney) with hearth, bed, table, chests; composter and hay under the front eave. L2 adds a porch, shutters, flower boxes, gable trim, woodpile, hay loft; L3 a 15-tall tower windmill beside it. The fields are separate modules (farm_field_*).",
